{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261102/photo/bkn-20261102215607712-1102_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261102215607\"/><p>馬曼婷的改革方案完成諮詢。</p><p>英國將改革永久居留制度，部分合法移民可能等10年甚至15年，才可獲得永居資格。內政大臣馬曼婷的改革方案完成諮詢，獲取永居資格的年期或由目前5年延長至10年，部分低學歷、低技術或低收入人士，包括護理員，可能要等多達15年。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:00:44.670822+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:56:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T15:38:38.278951+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:58:30.940677+00:00","content_hash":"16d50d27dc0c50c78d613a4d6983026b0a21b2a959b05caa8c6d05418885eb82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}